 largo del entrenamiento\")\nplt.grid(True)\nplt.show()\n\nplt.figure(figsize=(8, 4))\nplt.plot(range(1, epochs + 1), error_history, marker=\"o\", color=\"red\")\nplt.xlabel(\"Época\")\nplt.ylabel(\"Error Promedio\")\nplt.title(\"Evolución del Error Promedio\")\nplt.grid(True)\nplt.show()","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-08T00:24:15.040230Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-08T00:24:15.040618Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-08T00:24:15.460489Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-10-08T00:24:15.040578Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-08T00:24:15.459535Z"}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"<Figure size 800x400 with 1 Axes>","image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":"<Figure size 800x400 with 1 Axes>","image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}],"execution_count":1},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 2. Interpretación de Gráficas e Resultados\n* **Gráfica de Peso:** Muestra una asíntota horizontal que se estabiliza suavemente en $w = 2.0$ alrededor de la época 20.\n* **Gráfica de Error:** Muestra un decrecimiento monótono hacia cero, confirmando la convergencia del algoritmo.","metadata":{}}]}
